{"id":"gs13","类型":"讲义","科目":"高数","讲":"13","名称":"多元函数微分学","简称":"","简介":"二元函数的偏导、全微分、链式法则、隐函数求导、变量代换和极值。每年必考，小题考概念和求偏导，大题考复合求导、变量代换和极值。2010–2019 年 22 道真题都在这里。","intro":[],"sections":[{"id":"1","label":"节1","title":"偏导与全微分","minutes":30,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：求某一点的偏导、全微分；只给偏导的正负，比较两点函数值。选择、填空 4 分。2010–2019 年 2 道（只给偏导符号比大小）。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"1-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=x^3y^2-3xy$，求 $dz\\big|_{(1,1)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$dz\\big|_{(1,1)}=-dy$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=3x^2y^2-3y$，$z_x(1,1)=0$；$z_y=2x^3y-3x$，$z_y(1,1)=-1$。$dx$ 的系数是 0，所以 $dz=-dy$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"1-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"对任意 $(x,y)$ 有 $f_x<0$，$f_y>0$，比较 $f(1,3)$ 与 $f(2,1)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f(1,3)>f(2,1)$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"走折线 $(1,3)\\to(2,3)\\to(2,1)$：第一段 $x$ 变大，$f_x<0$，$f$ 变小；第二段 $y$ 变小，$f_y>0$，$f$ 也变小。两段都变小，所以 $f(1,3)>f(2,1)$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"偏导就是一元求导"},{"t":"p","text":"对 $x$ 求偏导：把 $y$ 当常数，按一元函数求导。记号 $z_x$、$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}$、$f'_x$ 都是它。"},{"t":"p","text":"全微分：$dz=z_x\\,dx+z_y\\,dy$；三元 $du=u_x\\,dx+u_y\\,dy+u_z\\,dz$。"},{"t":"p","text":"只要某一点的偏导时可以**先代后导**：求 $f_x(x_0,y_0)$，先把 $y=y_0$ 代进去，得到 $x$ 的一元函数再求导，往往省掉一大半计算。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"只给偏导的正负，比较两点的函数值","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 偏导的正负就是沿坐标方向的增减：$f_x>0$ 表示 $y$ 不动时 $x$ 越大 $f$ 越大；$f_y<0$ 表示 $x$ 不动时 $y$ 越大 $f$ 越小。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 从 $(x_1,y_1)$ 到 $(x_2,y_2)$ 走「先横后竖」的折线：$(x_1,y_1)\\to(x_2,y_1)\\to(x_2,y_2)$，两段各自看 $f$ 变大还是变小。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 两段都变大（或都变小）才能下结论；一段变大一段变小，就**无法确定**。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"求某一点的全微分","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=x^2y+e^{xy}$，求 $dz\\big|_{(1,1)}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=2xy+ye^{xy}$，代 $(1,1)$：$2+e$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_y=x^2+xe^{xy}$，代 $(1,1)$：$1+e$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$dz\\big|_{(1,1)}=(2+e)dx+(1+e)dy$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"折线比大小","q":[{"t":"p","text":"对任意 $(x,y)$ 有 $f_x>0$，$f_y>0$，比较 $f(0,0)$ 与 $f(1,2)$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"走折线 $(0,0)\\to(1,0)\\to(1,2)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"第一段 $y$ 不动、$x$ 从 0 到 1，$f_x>0$，所以 $f(1,0)>f(0,0)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"第二段 $x$ 不动、$y$ 从 0 到 2，$f_y>0$，所以 $f(1,2)>f(1,0)$。结论 $f(0,0)<f(1,2)$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["全微分只写了一项。系数为 0 的项可以不写，其余每一项都要写。","求某一点偏导时硬求偏导函数，算了一大串。能先代就先代。","折线两段一升一降，还硬选一个答案。这时是「无法确定」。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=x\\ln(x+y)$，求 $z_x(1,0)$、$z_y(1,0)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$z_x(1,0)=1$，$z_y(1,0)=1$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z_x$：$y$ 当常数，$x\\ln(x+y)$ 是乘积：$z_x=\\ln(x+y)+x\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x+y}$。代 $(1,0)$：$\\ln1+\\dfrac11=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_y$：$x$ 当常数，只有 $\\ln(x+y)$ 含 $y$：$z_y=\\dfrac{x}{x+y}$。代 $(1,0)$：$1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"对 $x$ 求偏导就把 $y$ 当常数，按一元函数求导；求完再代点。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=\\arctan\\dfrac yx$，求 $dz\\big|_{(1,1)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-\\frac12dx+\\frac12dy$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z=\\arctan u$，$u=\\dfrac yx$：$z_x=\\dfrac{1}{1+u^2}\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac y{x^2}\\right)=\\dfrac{x^2}{x^2+y^2}\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{y}{x^2}\\right)=-\\dfrac{y}{x^2+y^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_y=\\dfrac{1}{1+u^2}\\cdot\\dfrac1x=\\dfrac{x}{x^2+y^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $(1,1)$：$z_x=-\\frac12$，$z_y=\\frac12$，$dz=-\\frac12dx+\\frac12dy$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"全微分 $dz=z_xdx+z_ydy$：两个偏导都求出来，代点。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$u=xy^2z^3$，求 $du\\big|_{(1,1,1)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$dx+2dy+3dz$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=y^2z^3$，$u_y=2xyz^3$，$u_z=3xy^2z^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $(1,1,1)$：$1$、$2$、$3$。$du=dx+2dy+3dz$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"三元函数的全微分 $du=u_xdx+u_ydy+u_zdz$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=x^2+(y-2)e^{x\\sin y}$，求 $f_x(1,2)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先代 $y=2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(x,2)=x^2+(2-2)e^{2x\\sin2}=x^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f_x(1,2)=\\dfrac{d}{dx}x^2\\Big|_{x=1}=2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"只要某一点的偏导 → 先代后导：先把 $y=2$ 代进去，变成 $x$ 的一元函数再求导。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"硬求偏导函数也能做，但要对 $e^{x\\sin y}$ 求导，最后那一项乘 $(y-2)$ 还是 0——白算一大串。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"对任意 $(x,y)$ 有 $f_x>0$，$f_y>0$。(1) $f(0,0)$ 与 $f(1,1)$ 谁大？(2) $f(1,0)$ 与 $f(0,1)$ 谁大？"}],"options":{},"answer":"(1) $f(0,0)<f(1,1)$；(2) 无法确定。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① (1) 折线 $(0,0)\\to(1,0)\\to(1,1)$：第一段 $x$ 变大，$f_x>0$，$f$ 变大；第二段 $y$ 变大，$f_y>0$，$f$ 又变大。所以 $f(0,0)<f(1,1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② (2) 折线 $(1,0)\\to(0,0)\\to(0,1)$：第一段 $x$ 变小，$f$ 变小；第二段 $y$ 变大，$f$ 变大。一降一升，无法确定。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 举例确认：$f=x+2y$ 时 $f(1,0)=1<f(0,1)=2$；$f=2x+y$ 时 $f(1,0)=2>f(0,1)=1$。两种都可能。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"只给偏导的正负 → 走「先横后竖」的折线，两段同向才能下结论。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p6","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=e^x\\sin y$，求 $dz\\big|_{(0,\\frac\\pi2)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$dz=dx$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z_x=e^x\\sin y$，$z_y=e^x\\cos y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right)$：$z_x=1\\cdot1=1$，$z_y=1\\cdot0=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $dz=dx+0\\cdot dy=dx$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"求两个偏导，代点。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p7","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=x^y\\ (x>0)$，求 $dz\\big|_{(e,1)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$dx+e\\,dy$。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"对 $x$ 求偏导是幂函数，对 $y$ 求偏导是指数函数。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 对 $x$（$y$ 当常数，$x^y$ 是幂函数）：$z_x=yx^{y-1}$，在 $(e,1)$ 处为 $1\\cdot e^0=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 对 $y$（$x$ 当常数，$x^y$ 是指数函数）：$z_y=x^y\\ln x$，在 $(e,1)$ 处为 $e\\cdot1=e$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $dz=dx+e\\,dy$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"幂指函数对两个变量的偏导：对 $x$ 是幂函数求导，对 $y$ 是指数函数求导。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2012-05","src":{"year":2012,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x,y)$ 可微，且对任意的 $x,y$ 都有 $\\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y)}{\\partial x}>0$，$\\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y)}{\\partial y}<0$，则使不等式 $f(x_1,y_1)<f(x_2,y_2)$ 成立的一个充分条件是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$x_1>x_2,\\ y_1<y_2$","B":"$x_1>x_2,\\ y_1>y_2$","C":"$x_1<x_2,\\ y_1<y_2$","D":"$x_1<x_2,\\ y_1>y_2$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"从 $(x_1,y_1)$ 走到 $(x_2,y_2)$，要 $f$ 两段都变大。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x>0$：$x$ 要变大；$f_y<0$：$y$ 要变小。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 折线 $(x_1,y_1)\\to(x_2,y_1)\\to(x_2,y_2)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 第一段只有 $x$ 变：$f_x>0$，要 $f$ 变大，$x$ 必须变大：$x_1<x_2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第二段只有 $y$ 变：$f_y<0$，要 $f$ 变大，$y$ 必须变小：$y_1>y_2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 两段都变大，$f(x_1,y_1)<f(x_2,y_2)$。条件是 $x_1<x_2$、$y_1>y_2$，选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"只给偏导正负比大小 → 从 $(x_1,y_1)$ 走折线到 $(x_2,y_2)$，要 $f$ 两段都变大。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2017-05","src":{"year":2017,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x,y)$ 具有一阶偏导数，且对任意的 $(x,y)$，都有 $\\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y)}{\\partial x}>0$，$\\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y)}{\\partial y}<0$，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$f(0,0)>f(1,1)$","B":"$f(0,0)<f(1,1)$","C":"$f(0,1)>f(1,0)$","D":"$f(0,1)<f(1,0)$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"每个选项都走一条折线，看两段的增减是否一致。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$(0,1)\\to(1,1)\\to(1,0)$：$x$ 变大，$y$ 变小。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① C、D 比的是 $f(0,1)$ 和 $f(1,0)$。走 $(0,1)\\to(1,1)\\to(1,0)$：第一段 $x$ 变大，$f_x>0$，$f$ 变大；第二段 $y$ 变小，$f_y<0$，$f$ 又变大。所以 $f(0,1)<f(1,0)$，D 对。"},{"t":"p","text":"② A、B 比的是 $f(0,0)$ 和 $f(1,1)$。走 $(0,0)\\to(1,0)\\to(1,1)$：第一段变大，第二段 $y$ 变大、$f$ 变小，一升一降，无法确定。例如 $f=x-3y$ 时 $f(0,0)>f(1,1)$，$f=3x-y$ 时 $f(0,0)<f(1,1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"每个选项都走一条折线，看两段的增减是否一致；一致才能下结论。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"求偏导 → 别的变量当常数，只要某一点的值就先代后导；全微分每一项都写；只给偏导正负比大小 → 走「先横后竖」折线，两段同向才能下结论。"}]}]},{"id":"2","label":"节2","title":"四个概念：连续、偏导存在、可微、偏导连续","minutes":40,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：选择题判断分段函数在原点「连续吗、偏导存在吗、可微吗」。2010–2019 年没考，2020 年以后考了 2 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"2-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=\\dfrac{xy}{x^2+y^2}\\ ((x,y)\\ne(0,0))$，$f(0,0)=0$。在 (0,0) 处连续吗？两个偏导存在吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"不连续；两个偏导都存在，都是 0。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"沿 $y=kx$，$f=\\dfrac{k}{1+k^2}$，和 $k$ 有关，极限不存在，不连续。$f(x,0)=0$、$f(0,y)=0$，两个偏导都是 0。说明偏导存在推不出连续。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"2-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=(x^2+y^2)\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x^2+y^2}\\ ((x,y)\\ne(0,0))$，$f(0,0)=0$。在 (0,0) 处可微吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"可微，$df(0,0)=0$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,0)=x^2\\sin\\frac1{x^2}$，$f_x(0,0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}x\\sin\\frac1{x^2}=0$，同理 $f_y(0,0)=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{f(x,y)-0-0-0}{\\rho}=\\rho\\sin\\dfrac1{\\rho^2}$，绝对值不超过 $\\rho\\to0$，所以可微。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"四个概念的关系"},{"t":"math","tex":"\\text{偏导连续}\\Rightarrow\\text{可微}\\Rightarrow\\text{连续，且偏导存在}"},{"t":"p","text":"反过来都不对；「连续」和「偏导存在」互相推不出。下面以点 $(0,0)$ 为例，$\\rho=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"在分段点判断四个概念","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["**偏导**：分段点用定义。先写出 $x$ 轴上的 $f(x,0)$，$f_x(0,0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{f(x,0)-f(0,0)}{x}$，往往一眼看出。","**连续**：要 $\\lim f(x,y)=f(0,0)$。证明用夹逼：$|xy|\\le\\frac{x^2+y^2}2$，$|x|\\le\\rho$，$|y|\\le\\rho$。否定就找两条路径（常用 $y=kx$）极限不同。","**可微**：先求 $A=f_x(0,0)$、$B=f_y(0,0)$（有一个不存在就不可微），再看 $\\lim\\dfrac{f(x,y)-f(0,0)-Ax-By}{\\rho}$：等于 0 就可微，$df=A\\,dx+B\\,dy$；沿某条路径不是 0 就不可微。","**偏导连续**：在 $(x,y)\\ne(0,0)$ 处求出偏导函数，看它在 $(0,0)$ 的极限是不是等于 $f_x(0,0)$。"]}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"可微就是「放大看像一块平面」。$\\dfrac{xy}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}$ 无论放大多少倍，形状都一样，是个扭着的面，贴不上平面，所以不可微；$x^2+y^2$ 放大后越来越平，可微。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"连续、偏导存在，但不可微","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=\\dfrac{xy}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\\ ((x,y)\\ne(0,0))$，$f(0,0)=0$。在 (0,0) 处连续吗？偏导存在吗？可微吗？"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"连续：$|f|\\le\\dfrac{(x^2+y^2)/2}{\\rho}=\\dfrac\\rho2\\to0=f(0,0)$，连续。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"偏导：$f(x,0)=0$，所以 $f_x(0,0)=0$；同理 $f_y(0,0)=0$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"可微：$\\dfrac{f-0}{\\rho}=\\dfrac{xy}{x^2+y^2}$，沿 $y=kx$ 等于 $\\dfrac{k}{1+k^2}$，极限不存在，不可微。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"结论：连续且偏导存在，但不可微。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["分段点的偏导用公式求。分段点只能用定义。","以为偏导存在就连续。诊断 1 就是反例。","判断可微只算了 $A$、$B$，没算那个极限。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$。$f_x(0,0)$ 存在吗？$f$ 在 (0,0) 连续吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f_x(0,0)$ 不存在；连续。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 偏导：$f(x,0)=\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|$。$f_x(0,0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{|x|-0}{x}$：右极限 1，左极限 $-1$，不相等，不存在。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 连续：$f(x,y)=\\rho\\to0=f(0,0)$，连续。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 结论：连续推不出偏导存在。（$f$ 的图像是一个圆锥，尖点处没有切平面。）"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分段点（这里是尖点）的偏导用定义；连续看极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=|xy|$。在 (0,0) 处可微吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"可微，$df(0,0)=0$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(x,0)=0$，$f_x(0,0)=0$；$f(0,y)=0$，$f_y(0,0)=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\dfrac{f(x,y)-0-0-0}{\\rho}=\\dfrac{|xy|}{\\rho}\\le\\dfrac{(x^2+y^2)/2}{\\rho}=\\dfrac\\rho2\\to0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 极限为 0，可微，$df(0,0)=0\\cdot dx+0\\cdot dy=0$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"判断可微：先求两个偏导 $A$、$B$，再看 $\\dfrac{f-f(0,0)-Ax-By}{\\rho}\\to0$ 是否成立。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=\\dfrac{x^2y}{x^2+y^2}\\ ((x,y)\\ne(0,0))$，$f(0,0)=0$。在 (0,0) 处：连续吗？偏导存在吗？可微吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"连续；偏导都存在（都是 0）；不可微。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"可微那一步沿 $y=x$ 试试。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 连续：$\\left|\\dfrac{x^2y}{x^2+y^2}\\right|\\le|y|\\cdot\\dfrac{x^2}{x^2+y^2}\\le|y|\\to0$，连续。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 偏导：$f(x,0)=0$，$f_x(0,0)=0$；$f(0,y)=0$，$f_y(0,0)=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 可微：看 $\\dfrac{f-0}{\\rho}=\\dfrac{x^2y}{(x^2+y^2)^{3/2}}$。沿 $y=x$（$x>0$）：$\\dfrac{x^3}{(2x^2)^{3/2}}=\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{4}\\ne0$，不可微。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"三个概念逐一用定义查：连续用夹逼，偏导看 $f(x,0)$、$f(0,y)$，可微看那个极限沿 $y=x$ 是不是 0。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"判断对错：(1) 连续 ⇒ 偏导存在；(2) 可微 ⇒ 偏导连续；(3) 连续且偏导存在 ⇒ 可微；(4) 可微 ⇒ 连续且偏导存在。"}],"options":{},"answer":"(1)×　(2)×　(3)×　(4)√","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① (1) 连续 ⇒ 偏导存在：错，反例 $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$（练习 1）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② (2) 可微 ⇒ 偏导连续：错，反例诊断 2 的函数，可微但偏导函数在原点没有极限。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ (3) 连续且偏导存在 ⇒ 可微：错，反例本节例题 $\\dfrac{xy}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ (4) 可微 ⇒ 连续且偏导存在：对，这是关系链里的一环。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"记住关系链「偏导连续 ⇒ 可微 ⇒ 连续且偏导存在」，反方向都不对；每个「×」配一个反例。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知 $\\lim\\limits_{(x,y)\\to(0,0)}\\dfrac{f(x,y)-f(0,0)-2x+y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}=0$。$f$ 在 (0,0) 可微吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"可微，$df(0,0)=2dx-dy$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 题给 $\\dfrac{f(x,y)-f(0,0)-(2x-y)}{\\rho}\\to0$，也就是 $f(x,y)-f(0,0)=2x-y+o(\\rho)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 这正是可微的定义，$A=2$，$B=-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 可微，$df(0,0)=2dx-dy$（同时得到 $f_x(0,0)=2$，$f_y(0,0)=-1$）。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"可微的定义就是「$f-f(0,0)-Ax-By=o(\\rho)$」；把题给的式子和定义对照，读出 $A$、$B$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p6","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=\\dfrac{x^3+y^3}{x^2+y^2}\\ ((x,y)\\ne(0,0))$，$f(0,0)=0$。求 $f_x(0,0)$、$f_y(0,0)$，判断是否可微。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f_x(0,0)=f_y(0,0)=1$；不可微。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(x,0)=\\dfrac{x^3}{x^2}=x$，$f_x(0,0)=1$；$f(0,y)=y$，$f_y(0,0)=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 看 $\\dfrac{f-x-y}{\\rho}$。沿 $y=x$（$x>0$）：$f=\\dfrac{2x^3}{2x^2}=x$，$f-x-y=x-2x=-x$，$\\rho=\\sqrt2x$，比值 $=-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}=-\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\ne0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 不可微。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先用定义求偏导，再看 $\\dfrac{f-f(0,0)-Ax-By}{\\rho}$ 沿某条路径是否不趋于 0。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2020-5、2024-5。留到 11 月做整卷时再碰。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"四个概念 → 分段点偏导用定义（先写 $f(x,0)$）→ 可微看 $\\dfrac{f-f(0,0)-Ax-By}{\\rho}\\to0$ → 关系链：偏导连续 ⇒ 可微 ⇒ 连续且偏导存在，反过来都不对。"}]}]},{"id":"3","label":"节3","title":"复合函数求偏导：链式法则","minutes":45,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：抽象函数 $z=f(u,v)$ 求一阶、二阶偏导；证明 $x z_x+y z_y$ 这类式子等于什么；由复合关系反求 $f$ 的偏导。每年都考，2010–2019 年 7 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"3-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x^2-y^2,\\ xy)$，$f$ 可微，求 $z_x$、$z_y$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$z_x=2xf_1'+yf_2'$，$z_y=-2yf_1'+xf_2'$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$u=x^2-y^2$：$u_x=2x$，$u_y=-2y$；$v=xy$：$v_x=y$，$v_y=x$。每条路径乘起来再相加：$z_x=f_1'\\cdot2x+f_2'\\cdot y$，$z_y=f_1'\\cdot(-2y)+f_2'\\cdot x$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"3-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x+y,\\ xy)$，$f$ 有二阶连续偏导数，求 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2 z}{\\partial x\\partial y}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f_{11}''+(x+y)f_{12}''+xyf_{22}''+f_2'$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=f_1'+yf_2'$。再对 $y$ 求导：$f_1'$ 对 $y$ 求导得 $f_{11}''+xf_{12}''$；$yf_2'$ 对 $y$ 求导得 $f_2'+y(f_{21}''+xf_{22}'')$。"},{"t":"p","text":"合并，$f_{12}''=f_{21}''$：$f_{11}''+(x+y)f_{12}''+xyf_{22}''+f_2'$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"画变量树，每条路径乘起来再相加"},{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(u,v)$，$u=u(x,y)$，$v=v(x,y)$："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=f_1'\\cdot\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}+f_2'\\cdot\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial x}"},{"t":"p","text":"$f_1'$ 表示对第 1 个位置求偏导。**$f_1'$、$f_2'$ 仍然是 $(u,v)$ 的函数**，再对 $x$ 或 $y$ 求导时还要走一遍链式，这是二阶题最容易漏的地方。（公式本：[[多元:chain|链式法则]]）"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"抽象函数求偏导","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 画变量树：$z$ → $u$、$v$ → $x$、$y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 一阶：从 $z$ 到 $x$ 的每条路径，把路上的导数乘起来，再全部加起来。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 二阶：对一阶结果再求导。每一项是乘积就用乘积法则；碰到 $f_1'$、$f_2'$ 要再走一遍树：$\\dfrac{\\partial f_1'}{\\partial y}=f_{11}''u_y+f_{12}''v_y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 题目说「二阶连续偏导数」，就可以合并 $f_{12}''=f_{21}''$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 外层是一元函数 $z=f(u)$ 时：$z_x=f'(u)\\,u_x$，没有下标。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"一阶","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x^2-y^2,\\ e^{xy})$，求 $z_x$、$z_y$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"两条路径：$u=x^2-y^2$，$u_x=2x$，$u_y=-2y$；$v=e^{xy}$，$v_x=ye^{xy}$，$v_y=xe^{xy}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=2xf_1'+ye^{xy}f_2'$，$z_y=-2yf_1'+xe^{xy}f_2'$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"二阶：$f_2'$ 还要再求导","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x,\\ xy)$，$f$ 有二阶连续偏导数，求 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=f_1'\\cdot1+f_2'\\cdot y=f_1'+yf_2'$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f_1'$ 对 $y$ 求导：第 1 个位置是 $x$，对 $y$ 导数为 0；第 2 个位置是 $xy$，导数 $x$。得 $xf_{12}''$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$yf_2'$ 对 $y$ 求导：乘积法则 $f_2'+y\\cdot xf_{22}''$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}=xf_{12}''+f_2'+xyf_{22}''$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"由复合关系反求 f","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x-y,\\ xy)=x^2+y^2$，求 $f_u$、$f_v$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"把右边用 $u=x-y$、$v=xy$ 表示：$x^2+y^2=(x-y)^2+2xy=u^2+2v$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"所以 $f(u,v)=u^2+2v$，$f_u=2u$，$f_v=2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"凑不出来时，就解出 $x$、$y$ 用 $u$、$v$ 表示，再代进去。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["二阶时把 $f_1'$、$f_2'$ 当常数，漏了它们的链式那几项。","$z_x$ 里有 $y\\cdot f_2'$，对 $y$ 求导时忘了乘积法则，漏了 $f_2'$ 那一项。","外层一元函数还写 $f_1'$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f\\left(\\dfrac xy\\right)$，$f$ 可导，求 $xz_x+yz_y$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$0$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=\\dfrac1y$，$u_y=-\\dfrac{x}{y^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=\\dfrac1yf'$，$z_y=-\\dfrac{x}{y^2}f'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $xz_x+yz_y=\\dfrac xyf'-\\dfrac xyf'=0$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"外层是一元函数 $f(u)$，$u=\\frac xy$：$z_x=f'(u)u_x$，没有下标。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x+y,\\ x-y)$，求 $z_x+z_y$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2f_1'$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=1$，$v_x=1$：$z_x=f_1'+f_2'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $u_y=1$，$v_y=-1$：$z_y=f_1'-f_2'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x+z_y=2f_1'$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"画变量树：$z\\to u=x+y,\\ v=x-y\\to x,y$；每条路径相乘再相加。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=xf\\left(\\dfrac yx\\right)$，$f$ 可导，证明 $xz_x+yz_y=z$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"见解答。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z_x=f(u)+x\\cdot f'(u)\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac y{x^2}\\right)=f-\\dfrac yxf'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_y=x\\cdot f'(u)\\cdot\\dfrac1x=f'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $xz_x+yz_y=xf-yf'+yf'=xf=z$，得证。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=x\\cdot f(u)$，$u=\\frac yx$：乘积法则 + 链式法则。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(xy,\\ y)$，$f$ 有二阶连续偏导数，求 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f_1'+xyf_{11}''+yf_{12}''$。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=yf_1'$，对 $y$ 求导用乘积法则。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=xy$，$v=y$：$u_x=y$，$v_x=0$，所以 $z_x=yf_1'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 对 $y$ 求导，乘积法则：$z_{xy}=f_1'+y\\cdot\\dfrac{\\partial f_1'}{\\partial y}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\dfrac{\\partial f_1'}{\\partial y}=f_{11}''u_y+f_{12}''v_y=xf_{11}''+f_{12}''$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_{xy}=f_1'+y\\left(xf_{11}''+f_{12}''\\right)=f_1'+xyf_{11}''+yf_{12}''$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"二阶混合偏导：先求 $z_x$，再对 $y$ 求导；$f_1'$ 仍是 $(xy,y)$ 的函数，要再走一遍变量树。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"最常漏的是第②步乘积法则里的 $f_1'$ 那一项。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x+y,\\ x-y)=4xy$，求 $f(u,v)$ 和 $f_u+f_v$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f(u,v)=u^2-v^2$，$f_u+f_v=2u-2v$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $(x+y)^2-(x-y)^2=4xy$，所以 $4xy=u^2-v^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f(u,v)=u^2-v^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f_u=2u$，$f_v=-2v$，$f_u+f_v=2u-2v$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"由复合关系反求 $f$ → 把右边写成 $u=x+y$、$v=x-y$ 的式子。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p6","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$y=f(x,\\ x^2)$，$f$ 可微，求 $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f_1'+2xf_2'$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 两条路径：第 1 个位置是 $x$，导数 1；第 2 个位置是 $x^2$，导数 $2x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=f_1'\\cdot1+f_2'\\cdot2x=f_1'+2xf_2'$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"只有一个自变量 $x$（一元复合多元）：$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=f_1'\\cdot\\dfrac{d(x)}{dx}+f_2'\\cdot\\dfrac{d(x^2)}{dx}$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2016-06","src":{"year":2016,"no":6,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $f(x,y)=\\dfrac{e^x}{x-y}$，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$f'_x-f'_y=0$","B":"$f'_x+f'_y=0$","C":"$f'_x-f'_y=f$","D":"$f'_x+f'_y=f$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"直接求两个偏导。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f'_y=\\dfrac{e^x}{(x-y)^2}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f'_x$：商的求导，$\\dfrac{e^x(x-y)-e^x\\cdot1}{(x-y)^2}=\\dfrac{e^x}{x-y}-\\dfrac{e^x}{(x-y)^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f'_y$：$e^x$ 当常数，$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x-y}\\right)'_y=\\dfrac{1}{(x-y)^2}$，所以 $f'_y=\\dfrac{e^x}{(x-y)^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 相加：$f'_x+f'_y=\\dfrac{e^x}{x-y}=f$，选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"具体函数直接求两个偏导，再看选项里的组合。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2012-11","src":{"year":2012,"no":11,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=f\\left(\\ln x+\\dfrac1y\\right)$，其中函数 $f(u)$ 可微，则 $x\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+y^2\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$0$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"外层是一元函数：$z_x=f'\\cdot u_x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$u_x=\\frac1x$，$u_y=-\\frac1{y^2}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=\\dfrac1x$，$u_y=-\\dfrac1{y^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=\\dfrac1xf'$，$z_y=-\\dfrac1{y^2}f'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $xz_x+y^2z_y=f'-f'=0$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"外层是一元函数 $f(u)$，$u=\\ln x+\\frac1y$：$z_x=f'u_x$，$z_y=f'u_y$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2013-05","src":{"year":2013,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=\\dfrac yxf(xy)$，其中函数 $f$ 可微，则 $\\dfrac xy\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=$（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$2yf'(xy)$","B":"$-2yf'(xy)$","C":"$\\dfrac2xf(xy)$","D":"$-\\dfrac2xf(xy)$"},"answer":"A","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"乘积法则：$\\frac yx$ 和 $f(xy)$ 都要求导。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=-\\dfrac{y}{x^2}f+\\dfrac{y^2}{x}f'$，$z_y=\\dfrac1xf+yf'$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z_x=\\left(\\dfrac yx\\right)'_xf+\\dfrac yx\\cdot f'\\cdot y=-\\dfrac{y}{x^2}f+\\dfrac{y^2}{x}f'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_y=\\dfrac1xf+\\dfrac yx\\cdot f'\\cdot x=\\dfrac1xf+yf'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\dfrac xyz_x=-\\dfrac1xf+yf'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\dfrac xyz_x+z_y=\\left(-\\dfrac1xf+yf'\\right)+\\left(\\dfrac1xf+yf'\\right)=2yf'(xy)$，选 A。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$z$ 是 $\\frac yx$ 和 $f(xy)$ 的乘积 → 乘积法则，$f(xy)$ 再用链式。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2019-11","src":{"year":2019,"no":11,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(u)$ 可导，$z=yf\\left(\\dfrac{y^2}{x}\\right)$，则 $2x\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+y\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$yf\\left(\\dfrac{y^2}{x}\\right)$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=yf'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{y^2}{x^2}\\right)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_y=f+yf'\\cdot\\dfrac{2y}{x}$，乘积法则。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=-\\dfrac{y^2}{x^2}$，$u_y=\\dfrac{2y}{x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=y\\cdot f'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{y^2}{x^2}\\right)=-\\dfrac{y^3}{x^2}f'$，所以 $2xz_x=-\\dfrac{2y^3}{x}f'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_y=f+y\\cdot f'\\cdot\\dfrac{2y}{x}=f+\\dfrac{2y^2}{x}f'$，所以 $yz_y=yf+\\dfrac{2y^3}{x}f'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 相加：$2xz_x+yz_y=yf\\left(\\dfrac{y^2}x\\right)$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=y\\cdot f(u)$，$u=\\frac{y^2}x$：对 $x$ 只走链式，对 $y$ 要乘积法则 + 链式。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2015-05","src":{"year":2015,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(u,v)$ 满足 $f\\left(x+y,\\dfrac yx\\right)=x^2-y^2$，则 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial u}\\right|_{u=1,v=1}$，$\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial v}\\right|_{u=1,v=1}$ 依次是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$\\frac12,\\ 0$","B":"$0,\\ \\frac12$","C":"$-\\frac12,\\ 0$","D":"$0,\\ -\\frac12$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $u=x+y$，$v=\\frac yx$，把 $x$、$y$ 用 $u$、$v$ 解出来。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x=\\dfrac{u}{1+v}$，$y=\\dfrac{uv}{1+v}$，所以 $f(u,v)=\\dfrac{u^2(1-v)}{1+v}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $v=\\dfrac yx$ ⇒ $y=vx$；$u=x+y=x(1+v)$ ⇒ $x=\\dfrac{u}{1+v}$，$y=\\dfrac{uv}{1+v}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x^2-y^2=\\dfrac{u^2(1-v^2)}{(1+v)^2}=\\dfrac{u^2(1-v)}{1+v}$，所以 $f(u,v)=\\dfrac{u^2(1-v)}{1+v}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f_u=\\dfrac{2u(1-v)}{1+v}$，在 $(1,1)$ 为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $f_v=u^2\\cdot\\dfrac{-(1+v)-(1-v)}{(1+v)^2}=-\\dfrac{2u^2}{(1+v)^2}$，在 $(1,1)$ 为 $-\\dfrac24=-\\dfrac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 依次是 $0,-\\frac12$，选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"由复合关系反求 $f$：令 $u=x+y$、$v=\\frac yx$，把 $x$、$y$ 用 $u$、$v$ 解出来代进右边。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2011-17","src":{"year":2011,"no":17,"score":9,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $z=f\\bigl(xy,\\ yg(x)\\bigr)$，其中函数 $f$ 具有二阶连续偏导数，函数 $g(x)$ 可导且在 $x=1$ 处取得极值 $g(1)=1$，求 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial^2 z}{\\partial x\\partial y}\\right|_{x=1,y=1}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f_1'(1,1)+f_{11}''(1,1)+f_{12}''(1,1)$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"「$g$ 在 $x=1$ 取极值」给的是 $g'(1)=0$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=yf_1'+yg'(x)f_2'$；对 $y$ 求导后代 $x=y=1$，所有带 $g'(1)$ 的项都是 0。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 记 $u=xy$，$v=yg(x)$：$u_x=y$，$v_x=yg'(x)$；$u_y=x$，$v_y=g(x)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=yf_1'+yg'(x)f_2'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 对 $y$ 求导（两项都是乘积）："},{"t":"p","text":"$z_{xy}=f_1'+y\\left(f_{11}''u_y+f_{12}''v_y\\right)+g'(x)f_2'+yg'(x)\\left(f_{21}''u_y+f_{22}''v_y\\right)$"},{"t":"p","text":"$=f_1'+y\\left(xf_{11}''+g(x)f_{12}''\\right)+g'(x)f_2'+yg'(x)\\left(xf_{21}''+g(x)f_{22}''\\right)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 代 $x=y=1$：$g(1)=1$，$g'(1)=0$（可导函数在极值点导数为 0），$f$ 的自变量是 $(u,v)=(1,1)$。后两项都乘着 $g'(1)=0$，消失。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 结果 $f_1'(1,1)+f_{11}''(1,1)+f_{12}''(1,1)$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"抽象函数二阶混合偏导：先 $z_x$，再对 $y$ 求导（$f_1'$、$f_2'$ 还要走链式）；「$g$ 在 $x=1$ 取极值」翻译成 $g'(1)=0$，代值时带 $g'(1)$ 的项全消。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"题目给的「极值」「$g(1)=1$」都是为了最后代值时消项；先写出一般式再代值，不容易漏。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2017-16","src":{"year":2017,"no":16,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(u,v)$ 具有 2 阶连续偏导数，$y=f(e^x,\\cos x)$，求 $\\left.\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=0}$，$\\left.\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}\\right|_{x=0}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$y'(0)=f_1'(1,1)$；$y''(0)=f_{11}''(1,1)+f_1'(1,1)-f_2'(1,1)$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"一元复合多元：$y'=f_1'e^x-f_2'\\sin x$。$x=0$ 时自变量是 $(1,1)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"求二阶时 $f_1'$、$f_2'$ 还要再链式；代 $x=0$ 后 $\\sin x$ 的项都消失。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $y'=f_1'e^x-f_2'\\sin x$。$x=0$：$y'(0)=f_1'(1,1)\\cdot1-0=f_1'(1,1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 再求导。第一项 $f_1'e^x$：$\\left(f_{11}''e^x-f_{12}''\\sin x\\right)e^x+f_1'e^x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第二项 $-f_2'\\sin x$：$-\\left(f_{21}''e^x-f_{22}''\\sin x\\right)\\sin x-f_2'\\cos x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 代 $x=0$（$e^0=1$，$\\sin0=0$，$\\cos0=1$）：$y''(0)=f_{11}''(1,1)+f_1'(1,1)-f_2'(1,1)$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"一元复合多元：$y'=f_1'\\cdot(e^x)'+f_2'\\cdot(\\cos x)'$；求二阶时 $f_1'$、$f_2'$ 还是 $(e^x,\\cos x)$ 的函数，要再链式。$x=0$ 时自变量是 $(1,1)$，$\\sin0=0$ 让很多项消失。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2020-11、2021-6、2022-4、2026-14。留到 11 月做整卷时再碰。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"抽象函数求偏导 → 画变量树，每条路径相乘再相加 → 二阶时 $f_1'$、$f_2'$ 还要再走一遍树，乘积项别漏 → 反求 $f$ 就把右边写成 $u$、$v$ 的式子。"}]}]},{"id":"4","label":"节4","title":"隐函数求偏导与全微分","minutes":35,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：方程确定 $z=z(x,y)$，求某点的全微分或偏导；抽象方程 $F(\\cdots)=0$ 证一个恒等式。填空、选择 4 分，2010–2019 年 4 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"4-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x^2+y^2+z^2=4z$ 确定，求 $z_x$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$z_x=\\dfrac{x}{2-z}$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$F=x^2+y^2+z^2-4z$，$F_x=2x$，$F_z=2z-4$，$z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}=\\dfrac{x}{2-z}$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"4-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $e^z+xyz+x+y=1$ 确定，求 $dz\\big|_{(0,0)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-dx-dy$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"代 $x=y=0$：$e^z=1$，$z=0$。$F_x=yz+1=1$，$F_y=xz+1=1$，$F_z=e^z+xy=1$。$z_x=-1$，$z_y=-1$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"两种做法"},{"t":"p","text":"**公式法**：把方程移成 $F(x,y,z)=0$，"},{"t":"math","tex":"\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z},\\qquad\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=-\\frac{F_y}{F_z}"},{"t":"p","text":"这里 $F_x$ 是把 $x,y,z$ 都当独立变量、对 $x$ 求偏导（$z$ 当常数）。（公式本：[[多元:implicit|隐函数]]）"},{"t":"p","text":"**直接求导法**：方程两边对 $x$ 求导，**$z$ 是 $x,y$ 的函数**，碰到 $z$ 要乘 $z_x$，再解出 $z_x$。求二阶时用这个更顺。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"隐函数求偏导","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 求某一点的值：先代 $x_0,y_0$ 进方程，解出 $z_0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 一阶用公式 $-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$，每个偏导都代点算成数。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 二阶：对 $z_x$ 的表达式再对 $x$ 求导，式子里的 $z$ 仍是函数，求导出的 $z_x$ 再代回一阶结果。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 抽象方程 $F(\\cdots)=0$：把括号里的两块看成 $F$ 的第 1、2 个位置，用公式，$F_1'$、$F_2'$ 留着。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"求某点的全微分","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x^2+2y^2+3z^2=6$ 确定，且 $z(1,1)=1$，求 $dz\\big|_{(1,1)}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$F_x=2x$，$F_y=4y$，$F_z=6z$，代 $(1,1,1)$：$2$、$4$、$6$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=-\\frac26=-\\frac13$，$z_y=-\\frac46=-\\frac23$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$dz\\big|_{(1,1)}=-\\frac13dx-\\frac23dy$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"二阶偏导","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x^2+y^2+z^2=4z$ 确定，求 $z_{xx}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"诊断 1 已得 $z_x=\\dfrac{x}{2-z}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"再对 $x$ 求导（$z$ 是函数）：$z_{xx}=\\dfrac{(2-z)+xz_x}{(2-z)^2}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代入 $z_x=\\dfrac{x}{2-z}$：$z_{xx}=\\dfrac{(2-z)^2+x^2}{(2-z)^3}$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"抽象方程","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $F(x-az,\\ y-bz)=0$ 确定，$F$ 可微，$aF_1'+bF_2'\\ne0$。求 $az_x+bz_y$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"对 $x$ 求偏导（$z$ 当常数）：$F_x=F_1'$；对 $y$：$F_y=F_2'$；对 $z$：$F_z=-aF_1'-bF_2'$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=\\dfrac{F_1'}{aF_1'+bF_2'}$，$z_y=\\dfrac{F_2'}{aF_1'+bF_2'}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$az_x+bz_y=1$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["公式里漏了负号。","求 $F_x$ 时把 $z$ 也对 $x$ 求了导。公式法里 $z$ 当常数。","求某点的值，没先算出 $z_0$ 就代。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x+y+z=e^z$ 确定，求 $z_x$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac{1}{e^z-1}$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 移项：$F=x+y+z-e^z$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 求 $F_x$ 时 $z$ 当常数：$F_x=1$；$F_z=1-e^z$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x=-\\dfrac{1}{1-e^z}=\\dfrac{1}{e^z-1}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"公式法：移项成 $F(x,y,z)=0$，$z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"直接求导法也很快：两边对 $x$ 求导，$1+z_x=e^z\\cdot z_x$，解出 $z_x=\\dfrac1{e^z-1}$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $xz+yz^2+z=3$ 确定，且 $z(1,1)=1$，求 $dz\\big|_{(1,1)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-\\frac14dx-\\frac14dy$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F=xz+yz^2+z-3$：$F_x=z$，$F_y=z^2$，$F_z=x+2yz+1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $(1,1,1)$：$F_x=1$，$F_y=1$，$F_z=1+2+1=4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x=-\\frac14$，$z_y=-\\frac14$，$dz\\big|_{(1,1)}=-\\frac14dx-\\frac14dy$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"点已经给了（$z_0=1$），公式法求三个偏导，代点算成数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $z^3-3xyz=a^3$ 确定，求 $z_x$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac{yz}{z^2-xy}$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F=z^3-3xyz-a^3$：$F_x=-3yz$，$F_z=3z^2-3xy$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=-\\dfrac{-3yz}{3z^2-3xy}=\\dfrac{yz}{z^2-xy}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"公式法；求 $F_x$ 时 $y$、$z$ 都当常数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x+y+z=e^z$ 确定，求 $z_{xx}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-\\dfrac{e^z}{(e^z-1)^3}$。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=(e^z-1)^{-1}$，再对 $x$ 求导，别忘了乘 $z_x$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 由练习 1，$z_x=(e^z-1)^{-1}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 对 $x$ 求导：$z_{xx}=-(e^z-1)^{-2}\\cdot e^z\\cdot z_x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代入 $z_x=(e^z-1)^{-1}$：$z_{xx}=-\\dfrac{e^z}{(e^z-1)^3}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"二阶 → 对一阶结果再对 $x$ 求导。这时 $z$ 是 $x$ 的函数，对 $e^z$ 求导要乘 $z_x$，最后把 $z_x$ 代回。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"第②步的 $e^z\\cdot z_x$ 是关键：$z$ 不是常数，漏乘 $z_x$ 结果就错了。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $F\\left(\\dfrac xz,\\dfrac yz\\right)=0$ 确定，证明 $xz_x+yz_y=z$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"见解答。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F_x=F_1'\\cdot\\dfrac1z$，$F_y=F_2'\\cdot\\dfrac1z$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F_z=F_1'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{z^2}\\right)+F_2'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{y}{z^2}\\right)=-\\dfrac{xF_1'+yF_2'}{z^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}=\\dfrac{F_1'/z}{(xF_1'+yF_2')/z^2}=\\dfrac{zF_1'}{xF_1'+yF_2'}$；$z_y=-\\dfrac{F_y}{F_z}=\\dfrac{zF_2'}{xF_1'+yF_2'}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $xz_x+yz_y=\\dfrac{z\\,(xF_1'+yF_2')}{xF_1'+yF_2'}=z$，得证。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"抽象方程用公式法：$F$ 的第 1、2 个位置是 $\\frac xz$、$\\frac yz$；求 $F_x$、$F_y$、$F_z$ 时 $x,y,z$ 都当独立变量。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"「证 $xz_x+yz_y=\\cdots$」这类题，两个偏导分母相同，分子一合并正好是分母的倍数。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2014-11","src":{"year":2014,"no":11,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=z(x,y)$ 是由方程 $e^{2yz}+x+y^2+z=\\dfrac74$ 确定的函数，则 $dz\\Big|_{\\left(\\frac12,\\frac12\\right)}=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-\\frac12dx-\\frac12dy$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先代 $x=y=\\frac12$ 求出 $z$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z=0$。$F_x=1$，$F_y=2ze^{2yz}+2y$，$F_z=2ye^{2yz}+1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 代 $x=y=\\frac12$：$e^{z}+\\frac12+\\frac14+z=\\frac74$，即 $e^z+z=1$。左边随 $z$ 增大而增大，$z=0$ 是唯一的根。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F=e^{2yz}+x+y^2+z-\\frac74$：$F_x=1$，$F_y=2ze^{2yz}+2y$，$F_z=2ye^{2yz}+1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $\\left(\\frac12,\\frac12,0\\right)$：$F_x=1$，$F_y=0+1=1$，$F_z=1+1=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_x=-\\frac12$，$z_y=-\\frac12$，$dz=-\\frac12dx-\\frac12dy$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"求某点的全微分 → 先代点解出 $z_0$，再用 $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$、$z_y=-\\dfrac{F_y}{F_z}$ 算成数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2015-13","src":{"year":2015,"no":13,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"若函数 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $e^{x+2y+3z}+xyz=1$ 确定，则 $dz\\big|_{(0,0)}=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-\\frac13dx-\\frac23dy$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先求 $z(0,0)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z=0$；$F_x=e^{(\\cdot)}+yz$，$F_y=2e^{(\\cdot)}+xz$，$F_z=3e^{(\\cdot)}+xy$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x=y=0$：$e^{3z}=1$，$z=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F=e^{x+2y+3z}+xyz-1$：$F_x=e^{x+2y+3z}+yz$，$F_y=2e^{x+2y+3z}+xz$，$F_z=3e^{x+2y+3z}+xy$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $(0,0,0)$：$F_x=1$，$F_y=2$，$F_z=3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_x=-\\frac13$，$z_y=-\\frac23$，$dz=-\\frac13dx-\\frac23dy$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"和上一题一样：先代点求 $z_0$，再公式法。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2018-13","src":{"year":2018,"no":13,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $\\ln z+e^{z-1}=xy$ 确定，则 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{\\left(2,\\frac12\\right)}=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac14$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$xy=1$，试 $z=1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$F=\\ln z+e^{z-1}-xy$，$F_x=-y$，$F_z=\\frac1z+e^{z-1}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 代 $\\left(2,\\frac12\\right)$：$xy=1$，方程变成 $\\ln z+e^{z-1}=1$。左边随 $z$ 增大而增大；$z=1$ 时 $0+1=1$，所以 $z=1$ 是唯一的根。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F=\\ln z+e^{z-1}-xy$：$F_x=-y$，$F_z=\\dfrac1z+e^{z-1}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $\\left(2,\\frac12,1\\right)$：$F_x=-\\frac12$，$F_z=1+1=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_x=-\\dfrac{-1/2}{2}=\\dfrac14$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先代点求 $z_0$（解不出来就试一个整齐的数），再 $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$z_0$ 往往要「试」：$\\ln$ 配 $z=1$，指数配指数为 0。试出来后说一句「左边单调，根唯一」更严谨。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2010-05","src":{"year":2010,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $F\\left(\\dfrac yx,\\dfrac zx\\right)=0$ 确定，其中 $F$ 为可微函数，且 $F_2'\\ne0$，则 $x\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+y\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=$（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$x$","B":"$z$","C":"$-x$","D":"$-z$"},"answer":"B","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"公式法：$F_x=F_1'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac y{x^2}\\right)+F_2'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac z{x^2}\\right)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$F_y=\\dfrac1xF_1'$，$F_z=\\dfrac1xF_2'$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F_x=F_1'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{y}{x^2}\\right)+F_2'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{z}{x^2}\\right)=-\\dfrac{yF_1'+zF_2'}{x^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F_y=\\dfrac1xF_1'$，$F_z=\\dfrac1xF_2'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}=\\dfrac{yF_1'+zF_2'}{xF_2'}$，$z_y=-\\dfrac{F_y}{F_z}=-\\dfrac{F_1'}{F_2'}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $xz_x+yz_y=\\dfrac{yF_1'+zF_2'}{F_2'}-\\dfrac{yF_1'}{F_2'}=\\dfrac{zF_2'}{F_2'}=z$，选 B。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"抽象方程用公式法：第 1、2 个位置是 $\\frac yx$、$\\frac zx$；求 $F_x,F_y,F_z$ 时 $z$ 当常数。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"选择题可以代一个具体的 $F$ 检查：取 $F(u,v)=v-u$，方程变成 $z=y$，$xz_x+yz_y=0+y=z$，只有 B 对。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2021-13、2023-13、2025-1、2026-3。留到 11 月做整卷时再碰。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"隐函数 → 求点值先代点解出 $z_0$ → 一阶用 $-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$（$F_x$ 里 $z$ 当常数）→ 二阶对一阶结果再求导，$z$ 是函数 → 抽象方程把两块当第 1、2 个位置。"}]}]},{"id":"5","label":"节5","title":"由偏导还原函数；变量代换","minutes":40,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：已知偏导或全微分求 $f$；在变换 $\\xi=\\cdots$、$\\eta=\\cdots$ 下把偏微分方程化简，求参数。2010–2019 年 4 道，其中 2 道 10–11 分大题。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"5-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$df=2xy\\,dx+x^2dy$，$f(0,0)=0$，求 $f$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f=x^2y$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=2xy$，对 $x$ 积分：$f=x^2y+\\varphi(y)$。$f_y=x^2+\\varphi'(y)=x^2$，所以 $\\varphi'=0$，$\\varphi=C$；$f(0,0)=0$ 得 $C=0$。也可以直接凑：$2xy\\,dx+x^2dy=d(x^2y)$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"5-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$，令 $\\xi=x+y$，$\\eta=x-y$，$z=w(\\xi,\\eta)$。把 $z_x+z_y$ 用 $w$ 的偏导表示。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2w_\\xi$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=w_\\xi+w_\\eta$，$z_y=w_\\xi-w_\\eta$，相加得 $2w_\\xi$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"由偏导还原"},{"t":"p","text":"已知 $f_x$：对 $x$ 积分，常数换成 $y$ 的任意函数 $\\varphi(y)$，再用另一个条件（$f_y$ 或某条线上的值）定出 $\\varphi$。已知全微分同理，或者直接凑：$y\\,dx+x\\,dy=d(xy)$。"},{"t":"h","text":"变量代换"},{"t":"p","text":"把 $z(x,y)$ 写成新变量的函数 $w(\\xi,\\eta)$，用链式法则把 $z_x,z_y,z_{xx},\\dots$ 都换成 $w$ 的偏导，代进原方程，比较系数。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"变量代换题的步骤","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 写出 $\\xi_x,\\xi_y,\\eta_x,\\eta_y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 一阶：$z_x=w_\\xi\\xi_x+w_\\eta\\eta_x$，$z_y$ 同理。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 二阶：对一阶再求导，$w_\\xi$、$w_\\eta$ 仍是 $(\\xi,\\eta)$ 的函数，还要链式。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 代入原方程，按 $w_{\\xi\\xi},w_{\\xi\\eta},w_{\\eta\\eta},w_\\xi,\\dots$ 整理系数，令题目要消掉的那些系数为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 换成 $u=v\\,e^{ax+by}$ 这种乘积形式时，同样求导后约掉 $e^{ax+by}$ 再比较系数。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"由偏导还原","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=2x+y$，$f_y=x+2y$，$f(0,0)=0$，求 $f$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"对 $x$ 积分：$f=x^2+xy+\\varphi(y)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"对 $y$ 求导：$f_y=x+\\varphi'(y)=x+2y$，所以 $\\varphi'(y)=2y$，$\\varphi=y^2+C$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f(0,0)=0$ 得 $C=0$：$f=x^2+xy+y^2$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"化简二阶方程","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z_{xx}-z_{yy}=0$，令 $\\xi=x+y$，$\\eta=x-y$，化简。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=w_\\xi+w_\\eta$，$z_y=w_\\xi-w_\\eta$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z_{xx}=w_{\\xi\\xi}+2w_{\\xi\\eta}+w_{\\eta\\eta}$；$z_{yy}=w_{\\xi\\xi}-2w_{\\xi\\eta}+w_{\\eta\\eta}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"相减：$4w_{\\xi\\eta}=0$，即 $w_{\\xi\\eta}=0$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["对 $x$ 积分后常数还写成 $C$，应该是 $\\varphi(y)$。","二阶代换时把 $w_\\xi$ 当常数，漏了链式。","混合偏导 $w_{\\xi\\eta}$ 和 $w_{\\eta\\xi}$ 当成两项各算一遍又没合并。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=2xy+1$，$f(0,y)=y^2$，求 $f$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f=x^2y+x+y^2$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 对 $x$ 积分（$y$ 当常数）：$f=x^2y+x+\\varphi(y)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $x=0$：$f(0,y)=\\varphi(y)$，而题给 $f(0,y)=y^2$，所以 $\\varphi(y)=y^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f=x^2y+x+y^2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"已知 $f_x$ → 对 $x$ 积分，「常数」写成 $\\varphi(y)$，再用 $f(0,y)$ 定出 $\\varphi$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$df=e^y\\,dx+(xe^y+1)dy$，$f(0,0)=0$，求 $f$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f=xe^y+y$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f_x=e^y$，对 $x$ 积分：$f=xe^y+\\varphi(y)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f_y=xe^y+\\varphi'(y)$，和 $xe^y+1$ 比：$\\varphi'(y)=1$，$\\varphi=y+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f(0,0)=C=0$，所以 $f=xe^y+y$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"已知全微分 → $f_x=e^y$ 对 $x$ 积分，常数写成 $\\varphi(y)$，再用 $f_y$ 定出 $\\varphi$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"凑法更快：$e^ydx+xe^ydy=d(xe^y)$，所以 $df=d(xe^y)+dy=d(xe^y+y)$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"令 $\\xi=2x+y$，$\\eta=y$，$z=w(\\xi,\\eta)$。把方程 $z_x-2z_y=0$ 化简。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$w_\\eta=0$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\xi_x=2$，$\\xi_y=1$，$\\eta_x=0$，$\\eta_y=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=w_\\xi\\cdot2+w_\\eta\\cdot0=2w_\\xi$；$z_y=w_\\xi\\cdot1+w_\\eta\\cdot1=w_\\xi+w_\\eta$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x-2z_y=2w_\\xi-2w_\\xi-2w_\\eta=-2w_\\eta=0$，即 $w_\\eta=0$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"一阶代换：先写出 $\\xi_x,\\xi_y,\\eta_x,\\eta_y$，再用链式法则把 $z_x$、$z_y$ 换成 $w_\\xi$、$w_\\eta$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$w_\\eta=0$ 说明 $w$ 只和 $\\xi$ 有关：原方程的解都是 $z=\\varphi(2x+y)$ 的样子。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$u=v\\,e^{ax}$。$a$ 取何值时，$u_x+2u=0$ 化为 $v_x=0$？"}],"options":{},"answer":"$a=-2$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=v_xe^{ax}+v\\cdot ae^{ax}=(v_x+av)e^{ax}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $u_x+2u=(v_x+av+2v)e^{ax}=\\bigl(v_x+(a+2)v\\bigr)e^{ax}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $e^{ax}\\ne0$，约掉：$v_x+(a+2)v=0$。要化成 $v_x=0$，需 $a+2=0$，$a=-2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"乘积形式的代换：求导后约掉 $e^{ax}$，令 $v$ 那一项的系数为 0。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"令 $\\xi=x-y$，$\\eta=y$，$z=w(\\xi,\\eta)$。把 $z_{xx}+2z_{xy}+z_{yy}$ 用 $w$ 表示。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$w_{\\eta\\eta}$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\xi_x=1$，$\\xi_y=-1$，$\\eta_x=0$，$\\eta_y=1$。$z_x=w_\\xi$，$z_y=-w_\\xi+w_\\eta$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_{xx}=\\dfrac{\\partial w_\\xi}{\\partial x}=w_{\\xi\\xi}\\xi_x+w_{\\xi\\eta}\\eta_x=w_{\\xi\\xi}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_{xy}=\\dfrac{\\partial w_\\xi}{\\partial y}=w_{\\xi\\xi}\\cdot(-1)+w_{\\xi\\eta}\\cdot1=-w_{\\xi\\xi}+w_{\\xi\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_{yy}=\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(-w_\\xi+w_\\eta)=-(-w_{\\xi\\xi}+w_{\\xi\\eta})+(-w_{\\eta\\xi}+w_{\\eta\\eta})=w_{\\xi\\xi}-2w_{\\xi\\eta}+w_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 相加：$w_{\\xi\\xi}+2(-w_{\\xi\\xi}+w_{\\xi\\eta})+(w_{\\xi\\xi}-2w_{\\xi\\eta}+w_{\\eta\\eta})=w_{\\eta\\eta}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"二阶代换：先写一阶，再对一阶求导；$w_\\xi$、$w_\\eta$ 仍是 $(\\xi,\\eta)$ 的函数，求导时还要链式。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2017-12","src":{"year":2017,"no":12,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x,y)$ 具有一阶连续偏导数，且 $df(x,y)=ye^y\\,dx+x(1+y)e^y\\,dy$，$f(0,0)=0$，则 $f(x,y)=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$xye^y$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=ye^y$，对 $x$ 积分。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f=xye^y+\\varphi(y)$，再对 $y$ 求导对比。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f_x=ye^y$，对 $x$ 积分（$y$ 当常数）：$f=xye^y+\\varphi(y)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f_y=x(e^y+ye^y)+\\varphi'(y)=x(1+y)e^y+\\varphi'(y)$。和题给 $x(1+y)e^y$ 比：$\\varphi'(y)=0$，$\\varphi=C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f(0,0)=C=0$，所以 $f=xye^y$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"已知全微分求 $f$ → $f_x$ 对 $x$ 积分，常数写成 $\\varphi(y)$，再用 $f_y$ 定出 $\\varphi$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"也可以凑：$(ye^y)'=(1+y)e^y$，所以 $ye^ydx+x(1+y)e^ydy=ye^ydx+x\\,d(ye^y)=d(xye^y)$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2019-20","src":{"year":2019,"no":20,"score":11,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $u(x,y)$ 满足 $2\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}-2\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial y^2}+3\\dfrac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}+3\\dfrac{\\partial u}{\\partial y}=0$，求 $a,b$ 的值，使得在变换 $u(x,y)=v(x,y)e^{ax+by}$ 下，上述等式可化为 $v(x,y)$ 不含一阶偏导数的等式。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$a=-\\frac34$，$b=\\frac34$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$u_x=(v_x+av)e^{ax+by}$，$u_{xx}=(v_{xx}+2av_x+a^2v)e^{ax+by}$；$y$ 同理。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代入后约掉 $e^{ax+by}$，令 $v_x$、$v_y$ 的系数为 0。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=(v_x+av)e^{ax+by}$。再对 $x$ 求一次：括号求导得 $v_{xx}+av_x$；$e^{ax+by}$ 求导多乘一个 $a$，得 $a(v_x+av)$。合起来 $u_{xx}=(v_{xx}+2av_x+a^2v)e^{ax+by}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 对 $y$ 一样求：$u_y=(v_y+bv)e^{ax+by}$，$u_{yy}=(v_{yy}+2bv_y+b^2v)e^{ax+by}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代入 $2u_{xx}-2u_{yy}+3u_x+3u_y=0$，约掉 $e^{ax+by}$："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}&2v_{xx}-2v_{yy}+(4a+3)v_x+(3-4b)v_y\\\\&\\quad+(2a^2-2b^2+3a+3b)v=0\\end{aligned}"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 不含一阶偏导：$4a+3=0$，$3-4b=0$，所以 $a=-\\frac34$，$b=\\frac34$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"乘积代换 $u=ve^{ax+by}$：把 $u_x,u_{xx},u_y,u_{yy}$ 都写成「括号 $\\times\\,e^{ax+by}$」，代入约掉指数，令 $v_x$、$v_y$ 的系数为 0。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"这时 $v$ 的系数 $2a^2-2b^2+3a+3b$ 也恰好是 0，方程化成 $v_{xx}=v_{yy}$，可以用来检查。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2010-19","src":{"year":2010,"no":19,"score":11,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $u=f(x,y)$ 具有二阶连续偏导数，且满足等式 $4\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}+12\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x\\partial y}+5\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial y^2}=0$。确定 $a,b$ 的值，使等式在变换 $\\xi=x+ay$，$\\eta=x+by$ 下化简为 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial\\xi\\partial\\eta}=0$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$a=-\\frac25,\\ b=-2$ 或 $a=-2,\\ b=-\\frac25$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$u_x=u_\\xi+u_\\eta$，$u_y=au_\\xi+bu_\\eta$；二阶各求一遍。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代入后 $u_{\\xi\\xi}$ 的系数 $5a^2+12a+4$、$u_{\\eta\\eta}$ 的系数 $5b^2+12b+4$ 都要为 0，而且 $a\\ne b$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\xi_x=1$，$\\xi_y=a$，$\\eta_x=1$，$\\eta_y=b$。$u_x=u_\\xi+u_\\eta$，$u_y=au_\\xi+bu_\\eta$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $u_{xx}=u_{\\xi\\xi}+2u_{\\xi\\eta}+u_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $u_{xy}=\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(u_\\xi+u_\\eta)=(au_{\\xi\\xi}+bu_{\\xi\\eta})+(au_{\\eta\\xi}+bu_{\\eta\\eta})=au_{\\xi\\xi}+(a+b)u_{\\xi\\eta}+bu_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $u_{yy}=a(au_{\\xi\\xi}+bu_{\\xi\\eta})+b(au_{\\eta\\xi}+bu_{\\eta\\eta})=a^2u_{\\xi\\xi}+2abu_{\\xi\\eta}+b^2u_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 代入 $4u_{xx}+12u_{xy}+5u_{yy}$："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}&(5a^2+12a+4)u_{\\xi\\xi}+\\bigl(8+12(a+b)+10ab\\bigr)u_{\\xi\\eta}\\\\&\\quad+(5b^2+12b+4)u_{\\eta\\eta}=0\\end{aligned}"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ 要化成 $u_{\\xi\\eta}=0$：$a$、$b$ 都要是 $5t^2+12t+4=(5t+2)(t+2)=0$ 的根，即 $-\\frac25$ 或 $-2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑦ $a=b$ 时 $\\xi=\\eta$，变换退化，所以 $a\\ne b$。取 $a=-\\frac25$、$b=-2$：$u_{\\xi\\eta}$ 的系数 $8+12\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{12}5\\right)+10\\cdot\\frac45=-\\frac{64}5\\ne0$，两边除以它得 $u_{\\xi\\eta}=0$。$a=-2$、$b=-\\frac25$ 时系数也是 $-\\frac{64}5$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"线性代换：一阶、二阶都写成 $u_{\\xi\\xi},u_{\\xi\\eta},u_{\\eta\\eta}$，代入后让 $u_{\\xi\\xi}$、$u_{\\eta\\eta}$ 的系数为 0，$u_{\\xi\\eta}$ 的系数不为 0。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"「$a\\ne b$」和「$u_{\\xi\\eta}$ 的系数不为 0」是大题的得分点，别解出根就交卷。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2014-18","src":{"year":2014,"no":18,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(u)$ 具有 2 阶连续导数，$z=f(e^x\\cos y)$ 满足 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x^2}+\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial y^2}=(4z+e^x\\cos y)e^{2x}$。若 $f(0)=0$，$f'(0)=0$，求 $f(u)$ 的表达式。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f(u)=\\dfrac1{16}\\left(e^{2u}-e^{-2u}\\right)-\\dfrac u4$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"记 $u=e^x\\cos y$，算出 $z_{xx}+z_{yy}=f''(u)e^{2x}$，代进去得到关于 $f(u)$ 的方程。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f''(u)=4f(u)+u$。解这个二阶常系数方程要用第 15 讲，还没学可以先做到这一步，看解答。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u_x=e^x\\cos y$，$u_y=-e^x\\sin y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=f'(u)e^x\\cos y$。再对 $x$ 求导（乘积法则，$f'(u)$ 还要链式）：$z_{xx}=f''(u)e^{2x}\\cos^2y+f'(u)e^x\\cos y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_y=-f'(u)e^x\\sin y$，$z_{yy}=f''(u)e^{2x}\\sin^2y-f'(u)e^x\\cos y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 相加：$\\cos^2y+\\sin^2y=1$，$f'$ 的两项抵消，$z_{xx}+z_{yy}=f''(u)e^{2x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 代入题给等式：$f''(u)e^{2x}=\\bigl(4f(u)+u\\bigr)e^{2x}$，即 $f''(u)-4f(u)=u$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ 解方程（第 15 讲）：$r^2-4=0$，$r=\\pm2$；设特解 $Au+B$，代入得 $-4(Au+B)=u$，$A=-\\frac14$，$B=0$。通解 $f=C_1e^{2u}+C_2e^{-2u}-\\frac u4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑦ $f(0)=C_1+C_2=0$；$f'(0)=2C_1-2C_2-\\frac14=0$。解得 $C_1=\\frac1{16}$，$C_2=-\\frac1{16}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"外层是一元函数 $z=f(u)$，$u=e^x\\cos y$：先算 $z_{xx}+z_{yy}$，会发现正好是 $f''(u)e^{2x}$，代入得到 $f$ 满足的微分方程。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"本讲要会的是①–⑤：把偏导等式变成 $f''=4f+u$。⑥⑦是微分方程，学完第 15 讲再回来看。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2024-20。留到 11 月做整卷时再碰。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"还原 $f$ → 对一个变量积分，常数写成另一个变量的函数，再用另一个条件定 → 变量代换 → 一阶二阶都用新变量表示（$w_\\xi$ 还要链式）→ 代入整理系数，令该消的为 0。"}]}]},{"id":"6","label":"节6","title":"多元函数的极值","minutes":45,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：求二元函数的极值（常先还原函数或由隐函数确定）；选择题判断极值的充分条件。10–11 分大题，2010–2019 年 5 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"6-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f(x,y)=x^2+xy+y^2-3x$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极小值 $f(2,-1)=-3$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=2x+y-3=0$，$f_y=x+2y=0$，得 $(2,-1)$。$A=2$，$B=1$，$C=2$，$AC-B^2=3>0$，$A>0$，极小值 $-3$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"6-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=x^3-3xy+y^3$。点 $(0,0)$ 和 $(1,1)$ 是不是极值点？"}],"options":{},"answer":"$(0,0)$ 不是；$(1,1)$ 是极小值点，极小值 $-1$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$(0,0)$：$A=0$，$B=-3$，$C=0$，$AC-B^2=-9<0$，不是极值点。$(1,1)$：$A=6$，$B=-3$，$C=6$，$AC-B^2=27>0$，$A>0$，极小值 $f(1,1)=-1$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"无条件极值的三步"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"求二元函数的极值","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 驻点：解 $f_x=0$，$f_y=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 每个驻点算 $A=f_{xx}$，$B=f_{xy}$，$C=f_{yy}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $AC-B^2>0$：是极值，$A>0$ 极小、$A<0$ 极大；$AC-B^2<0$：不是极值；$AC-B^2=0$：这个方法判断不了，要另想办法。（公式本：[[多元:extreme|极值判别]]）"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 隐函数 $z=z(x,y)$ 的极值：$z_x=z_y=0$ 就是 $F_x=F_y=0$，和原方程联立解出点和 $z$；在驻点处 $A=-\\dfrac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$，$B=-\\dfrac{F_{xy}}{F_z}$，$C=-\\dfrac{F_{yy}}{F_z}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 函数没直接给出（给的是偏导、全微分）时，先按节5 还原，再求极值。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"$AC-B^2<0$ 的点是「马鞍点」：沿一个方向是最低点，沿另一个方向是最高点，所以不是极值。$f=x^2-y^2$ 在原点就是这样。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"指数乘多项式","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f(x,y)=e^{2x}(x+y^2+2y)$ 的极值。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=e^{2x}(2x+2y^2+4y+1)$，$f_y=e^{2x}(2y+2)$。由 $f_y=0$ 得 $y=-1$，代入 $f_x=0$ 得 $x=\\frac12$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$A=f_{xx}=e^{2x}(4x+4y^2+8y+4)$，在 $\\left(\\frac12,-1\\right)$ 为 $2e$；$B=f_{xy}=e^{2x}(4y+4)=0$；$C=2e^{2x}=2e$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$AC-B^2=4e^2>0$，$A>0$，极小值 $f\\left(\\frac12,-1\\right)=-\\frac e2$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"隐函数的极值","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x^2+y^2+z^2-2x+2y-4z-10=0$ 确定，求 $z$ 的极值。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$F_x=2x-2=0$，$F_y=2y+2=0$：$x=1$，$y=-1$。代回方程：$z^2-4z-12=0$，$z=6$ 或 $z=-2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$F_{xx}=F_{yy}=2$，$F_{xy}=0$，$F_z=2z-4$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$z=6$ 时 $F_z=8$，$A=C=-\\frac14$，$B=0$：极大值 6。$z=-2$ 时 $F_z=-8$，$A=C=\\frac14$：极小值 $-2$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["只求了驻点，没判断 $AC-B^2$ 就说是极值。","$AC-B^2=0$ 时硬下结论。","隐函数极值忘了把点代回原方程求 $z$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f(x,y)=4(x-y)-x^2-y^2$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极大值 $f(2,-2)=8$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f_x=4-2x=0$，$f_y=-4-2y=0$：驻点 $(2,-2)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $A=f_{xx}=-2$，$B=f_{xy}=0$，$C=f_{yy}=-2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $AC-B^2=4>0$，$A<0$，极大值 $f(2,-2)=16-4-4=8$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"无条件极值三步：驻点 → 算 $A$、$B$、$C$ → 看 $AC-B^2$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"配方也能看出来：$f=8-(x-2)^2-(y+2)^2$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f(x,y)=x^3-3x+y^2$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极小值 $f(1,0)=-2$；$(-1,0)$ 不是极值点。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f_x=3x^2-3=0$，$f_y=2y=0$：驻点 $(1,0)$、$(-1,0)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $A=6x$，$B=0$，$C=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $(1,0)$：$A=6$，$AC-B^2=12>0$，$A>0$，极小值 $f(1,0)=1-3=-2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $(-1,0)$：$A=-6$，$AC-B^2=-12<0$，不是极值点。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"每个驻点都要单独判断，驻点不一定是极值点。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(0)=1$，$g(0)=2$，$f'(0)=g'(0)=0$，$f''(0)=-1$，$g''(0)=-3$。$z=f(x)g(y)$ 在 $(0,0)$ 处是极大、极小还是不是极值？"}],"options":{},"answer":"极大值，$z(0,0)=2$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z_x=f'(x)g(y)$，$z_y=f(x)g'(y)$，在 $(0,0)$ 都是 0，是驻点。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $A=f''(x)g(y)$，$B=f'(x)g'(y)$，$C=f(x)g''(y)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $(0,0)$：$A=(-1)\\cdot2=-2$，$B=0$，$C=1\\cdot(-3)=-3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $AC-B^2=6>0$，$A<0$，极大值 $z(0,0)=f(0)g(0)=2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x)g(y)$ 两个变量分开了：对 $x$ 求导只动 $f$，对 $y$ 求导只动 $g$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=z(x,y)$ 由 $x^2+y^2+z^2=4z$ 确定，求 $z$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极大值 4，极小值 0（都在 $x=y=0$ 处）。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F=x^2+y^2+z^2-4z$：$F_x=2x=0$，$F_y=2y=0$，得 $x=y=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代回原方程：$z^2=4z$，$z=0$ 或 $z=4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $F_{xx}=2$，$F_{xy}=0$，$F_{yy}=2$，$F_z=2z-4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z=4$：$F_z=4$，$A=C=-\\frac12$，$B=0$，$AC-B^2=\\frac14>0$，$A<0$，极大值 4。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $z=0$：$F_z=-4$，$A=C=\\frac12$，$B=0$，$AC-B^2>0$，$A>0$，极小值 0。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"隐函数极值：$F_x=F_y=0$ 和原方程联立求点和 $z$；判别用 $A=-\\dfrac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$、$B=-\\dfrac{F_{xy}}{F_z}$、$C=-\\dfrac{F_{yy}}{F_z}$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"方程就是球面 $x^2+y^2+(z-2)^2=4$：最高点 $z=4$，最低点 $z=0$，和结果一致。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=x^2-y^2$，$(0,0)$ 是极值点吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"不是，$(0,0)$ 是马鞍点。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f_x=2x$，$f_y=-2y$，在 $(0,0)$ 都是 0，是驻点。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $A=2$，$B=0$，$C=-2$，$AC-B^2=-4<0$，不是极值点。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 直接看也行：沿 $x$ 轴 $f=x^2\\ge0$，沿 $y$ 轴 $f=-y^2\\le0$，原点附近有正有负，$f(0,0)=0$ 不是极值。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先确认是驻点，再算 $AC-B^2$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2011-05","src":{"year":2011,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x)$，$g(x)$ 均有二阶连续导数，满足 $f(0)>0$，$g(0)<0$，且 $f'(0)=g'(0)=0$，则函数 $z=f(x)g(y)$ 在点 $(0,0)$ 处取得极小值的一个充分条件是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$f''(0)<0,\\ g''(0)>0$","B":"$f''(0)<0,\\ g''(0)<0$","C":"$f''(0)>0,\\ g''(0)>0$","D":"$f''(0)>0,\\ g''(0)<0$"},"answer":"A","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"在 $(0,0)$ 算 $A$、$B$、$C$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$A=f''(0)g(0)$，$B=0$，$C=f(0)g''(0)$；极小要 $A>0$、$C>0$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $z_x=f'(x)g(y)$，$z_y=f(x)g'(y)$，在 $(0,0)$ 都为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $A=f''(0)g(0)$，$B=f'(0)g'(0)=0$，$C=f(0)g''(0)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $B=0$，所以极小的充分条件是 $A>0$ 且 $AC>0$，也就是 $A>0$、$C>0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $A=f''(0)g(0)>0$，而 $g(0)<0$，所以 $f''(0)<0$；$C=f(0)g''(0)>0$，而 $f(0)>0$，所以 $g''(0)>0$。选 A。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$z=f(x)g(y)$ 在 $(0,0)$ 是驻点（$f'(0)=g'(0)=0$）；算 $A$、$B$、$C$，极小要 $AC-B^2>0$ 且 $A>0$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$g(0)<0$ 会把符号翻过来，所以答案不是直觉上的「两个二阶导都大于 0」（C）。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2014-06","src":{"year":2014,"no":6,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $u(x,y)$ 在有界闭区域 $D$ 上连续，在 $D$ 的内部具有 2 阶连续偏导数，且满足 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x\\partial y}\\ne0$ 及 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}+\\dfrac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial y^2}=0$，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$u(x,y)$ 的最大值和最小值都在 $D$ 的边界上取得","B":"$u(x,y)$ 的最大值和最小值都在 $D$ 的内部取得","C":"$u(x,y)$ 的最大值在 $D$ 的内部取得，最小值在 $D$ 的边界上取得","D":"$u(x,y)$ 的最小值在 $D$ 的内部取得，最大值在 $D$ 的边界上取得"},"answer":"A","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"如果最值在内部取得，那一点就是极值点。看看内部能不能有极值点。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$C=-A$，所以 $AC-B^2=-A^2-B^2$，而 $B\\ne0$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 记 $A=u_{xx}$，$B=u_{xy}$，$C=u_{yy}$。题给 $A+C=0$，所以 $C=-A$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 内部任一点：$AC-B^2=-A^2-B^2$。因为 $B\\ne0$，所以 $AC-B^2<0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 如果最值在内部某点取得，那点是极值点，也是驻点；可驻点处 $AC-B^2<0$，不是极值点，矛盾。所以内部取不到最值。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $u$ 在有界闭区域上连续，一定有最大值和最小值，只能在边界上取得。选 A。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"最值如果在内部取得，那一点就是极值点；看内部能不能有极值点。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"这题不用知道 $u$ 是什么：$AC-B^2$ 在内部处处小于 0，内部「处处是马鞍」。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2012-16","src":{"year":2012,"no":16,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求函数 $f(x,y)=xe^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}}$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极大值 $f(1,0)=e^{-\\frac12}$，极小值 $f(-1,0)=-e^{-\\frac12}$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x=(1-x^2)e^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}2}$，$f_y=-xye^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}2}$。驻点 $(\\pm1,0)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$A=(x^3-3x)e^{(\\cdot)}$，$B=-(1-x^2)ye^{(\\cdot)}$，$C=(xy^2-x)e^{(\\cdot)}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 记 $E=e^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}2}$，则 $E_x=-xE$，$E_y=-yE$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f_x=E+x\\cdot(-xE)=(1-x^2)E$，$f_y=x\\cdot(-yE)=-xyE$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 驻点：$E>0$，所以 $1-x^2=0$ 且 $xy=0$，得 $(1,0)$、$(-1,0)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 二阶：$A=-2xE+(1-x^2)(-xE)=(x^3-3x)E$；$B=(1-x^2)(-yE)$；$C=-xE+(-xy)(-yE)=(xy^2-x)E$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $(1,0)$：$A=-2e^{-\\frac12}$，$B=0$，$C=-e^{-\\frac12}$，$AC-B^2=2e^{-1}>0$，$A<0$，极大值 $f(1,0)=e^{-\\frac12}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ $(-1,0)$：$A=2e^{-\\frac12}$，$B=0$，$C=e^{-\\frac12}$，$AC-B^2>0$，$A>0$，极小值 $f(-1,0)=-e^{-\\frac12}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"驻点 → $A,B,C$ → 判别。$e^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}2}$ 恒正，解驻点、判符号时可以先提出来。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(-x,y)=-f(x,y)$，所以极大、极小成对出现，正好互为相反数，可以用来检查。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2015-17","src":{"year":2015,"no":17,"score":11,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $f(x,y)$ 满足 $f''_{xy}(x,y)=2(y+1)e^x$，$f'_x(x,0)=(x+1)e^x$，$f(0,y)=y^2+2y$，求 $f(x,y)$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极小值 $f(0,-1)=-1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先还原：对 $y$ 积分得 $f'_x$，用 $f'_x(x,0)$ 定积分「常数」；再对 $x$ 积分，用 $f(0,y)$ 定。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=e^x(y^2+2y+x)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f''_{xy}=2(y+1)e^x$ 对 $y$ 积分（$x$ 当常数）：$f'_x=(y^2+2y)e^x+\\varphi(x)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $y=0$：$f'_x(x,0)=\\varphi(x)$，而题给 $(x+1)e^x$，所以 $\\varphi(x)=(x+1)e^x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f'_x=(y^2+2y)e^x+(x+1)e^x$ 对 $x$ 积分：$\\int(x+1)e^xdx=xe^x$，所以 $f=(y^2+2y)e^x+xe^x+\\psi(y)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 代 $x=0$：$f(0,y)=y^2+2y+\\psi(y)=y^2+2y$，$\\psi(y)=0$。$f=e^x(y^2+2y+x)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 驻点：$f_x=e^x(y^2+2y+x+1)=0$，$f_y=e^x(2y+2)=0$。由第二个 $y=-1$，代入第一个 $1-2+x+1=0$，$x=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ $A=e^x(y^2+2y+x+2)$，在 $(0,-1)$ 为 1；$B=2(y+1)e^x=0$；$C=2e^x=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑦ $AC-B^2=2>0$，$A>0$，极小值 $f(0,-1)=1-2+0=-1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"函数没直接给出 → 先还原（积两次，每次用一个条件定「常数」），再按三步求极值。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"对 $y$ 积分时「常数」是 $x$ 的函数 $\\varphi(x)$，对 $x$ 积分时才是 $\\psi(y)$，方向别弄反。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2016-17","src":{"year":2016,"no":17,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $(x^2+y^2)z+\\ln z+2(x+y+1)=0$ 确定，求 $z=z(x,y)$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极大值 $z(-1,-1)=1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$F_x=2xz+2=0$，$F_y=2yz+2=0$，所以 $x=y=-\\frac1z$，代回方程解 $z$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代回得 $\\ln z-\\frac2z+2=0$，$z=1$（左边单调递增，只有这一个根）。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F=(x^2+y^2)z+\\ln z+2(x+y+1)$：$F_x=2xz+2$，$F_y=2yz+2$，$F_z=x^2+y^2+\\dfrac1z$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F_x=F_y=0$：$x=y=-\\dfrac1z$。代回原方程：$\\dfrac2{z^2}\\cdot z+\\ln z+2\\left(1-\\dfrac2z\\right)=0$，即 $\\ln z-\\dfrac2z+2=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $g(z)=\\ln z-\\dfrac2z+2$ 在 $z>0$ 上 $g'=\\dfrac1z+\\dfrac2{z^2}>0$，严格增；$g(1)=0$，所以 $z=1$ 是唯一解，$x=y=-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $F_{xx}=2z=2$，$F_{xy}=0$，$F_{yy}=2z=2$，$F_z=1+1+1=3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $A=-\\frac23$，$B=0$，$C=-\\frac23$，$AC-B^2=\\frac49>0$，$A<0$，极大值 $z(-1,-1)=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"隐函数极值：$F_x=F_y=0$ 和原方程联立，解出点和 $z$；判别用 $A=-\\dfrac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$ 等。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$A=-\\dfrac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$ 只在驻点用：那里 $z_x=z_y=0$，求二阶时其余各项都消掉了。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2020-17、2022-20、2023-18、2024-12、2025-19、2026-19。留到 11 月做整卷时再碰。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"求极值 → 驻点 → 每点算 $A$、$B$、$C$ → $AC-B^2>0$ 才是极值（$A>0$ 小、$A<0$ 大），$<0$ 不是 → 隐函数用 $F_x=F_y=0$ 加原方程，$A=-\\dfrac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$ → 函数没给出就先还原。"}]}]},{"id":"zf","label":"总复习","title":"方法地图 · 题眼 · 混合自测","minutes":50,"kind":"review","blocks":[{"t":"p","text":"这一讲其实就两件事：**求偏导**（具体函数、抽象复合、隐函数、变量代换）和**用偏导**（比大小、判可微、求极值）。总复习先过每节的方法，再练「看到什么想到什么」，最后做一组不告诉你节号的混合题。"},{"t":"cards","items":[["只要某一点的偏导，比如 $f_x(1,2)$","先代后导：先代 $y=2$，变成 $x$ 的一元函数再求导"],["只给 $f_x$、$f_y$ 的正负，比较两点的函数值","走「先横后竖」的折线；两段同向才能下结论，一升一降就是无法确定"],["分段函数在分段点求偏导","只能用定义：先写出 $f(x,0)$，再求 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x,0)-f(0,0)}{x}$"],["问在 $(0,0)$ 可不可微","先求 $A=f_x(0,0)$、$B=f_y(0,0)$，再看 $\\frac{f-f(0,0)-Ax-By}{\\rho}$ 是否趋于 0"],["二元函数的极限","证为 0 用夹逼：$|xy|\\le\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}$，$|x|\\le\\rho$；说明不存在就沿 $y=kx$ 算出和 $k$ 有关"],["连续、偏导存在、可微、偏导连续的关系","偏导连续 ⇒ 可微 ⇒ 连续且偏导存在；反过来都不对，连续和偏导存在互相推不出"],["$z=f(u,v)$，$u$、$v$ 又是 $x,y$ 的函数","画变量树，每条路径的导数乘起来再相加"],["抽象函数求 $\\frac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}$","$z_x$ 里的 $f_1'$、$f_2'$ 对 $y$ 还要再走一遍树；$y\\cdot f_2'$ 这种乘积项用乘积法则"],["外层是一元函数 $z=f(u)$","$z_x=f'(u)\\,u_x$，写 $f'$，不写 $f_1'$"],["已知 $f\\left(x+y,\\frac yx\\right)$ 等于某式，求 $f_u$","令 $u=x+y$、$v=\\frac yx$，解出 $x$、$y$ 代进去，先写出 $f(u,v)$"],["$f(x,x^2)=1$ 这种对所有 $x$ 成立的式子","两边对 $x$ 求导：$f_1'+2xf_2'=0$"],["方程确定 $z=z(x,y)$，求某点的全微分","先代点解出 $z_0$，再 $z_x=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z}$（$F_x$ 里 $z$ 当常数）"],["隐函数求二阶偏导","对一阶结果再求导，这时 $z$ 是函数：碰到 $z$ 乘 $z_x$，最后把 $z_x$ 代回"],["已知 $f_x$ 或 $df$，求 $f$","对 $x$ 积分，常数写成 $\\varphi(y)$，再用 $f_y$ 或已知的值定出来"],["用 $\\xi$、$\\eta$ 代换化简方程，求参数","一阶二阶都换成新变量的偏导，代入比系数：该消的为 0，留下的不为 0"],["$u=v\\,e^{ax+by}$，要消掉一阶偏导","求导后约掉 $e^{ax+by}$，令 $v_x$、$v_y$ 的系数为 0"],["求二元函数的极值","驻点 → 每点算 $A$、$B$、$C$ → $AC-B^2>0$ 才是极值（$A>0$ 极小），$<0$ 不是，$=0$ 判断不了"],["$z=z(x,y)$ 由方程确定，求极值","$F_x=F_y=0$ 和原方程联立求点和 $z$；$A=-\\frac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$，$B$、$C$ 一样"],["只给二阶偏导的条件，问最值在内部还是边界","内部处处 $AC-B^2<0$ 就没有极值点，最值只能在边界上"]]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $2\\sin(x+2y-3z)=x+2y-3z$ 确定，且 $2\\cos(x+2y-3z)\\ne1$，求 $\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"公式法，$F=2\\sin(x+2y-3z)-(x+2y-3z)$，记 $c=\\cos(x+2y-3z)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$F_x=2c-1$，$F_y=2(2c-1)$，$F_z=-3(2c-1)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 移项：$F(x,y,z)=2\\sin(x+2y-3z)-(x+2y-3z)$，记 $c=\\cos(x+2y-3z)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x,y,z$ 都当独立变量求偏导：$F_x=2c-1$，$F_y=4c-2=2(2c-1)$，$F_z=-6c+3=-3(2c-1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}=\\dfrac{2c-1}{3(2c-1)}=\\dfrac13$，$z_y=-\\dfrac{F_y}{F_z}=\\dfrac{2(2c-1)}{3(2c-1)}=\\dfrac23$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_x+z_y=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"隐函数求一阶偏导 → 公式法 $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$。三个偏导有公因子 $2c-1$，约掉后是常数。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"条件 $2\\cos(\\cdot)\\ne1$ 就是保证 $F_z\\ne0$，公式法才能用。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"4"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=f(2x-y,\\ y\\sin x)$，$f$ 有二阶连续偏导数，求 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-2f_{11}''+(2\\sin x-y\\cos x)f_{12}''+y\\sin x\\cos x\\,f_{22}''+\\cos x\\,f_2'$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$u=2x-y$，$v=y\\sin x$：$z_x=2f_1'+y\\cos x\\,f_2'$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"再对 $y$ 求导：$2f_1'$ 走一遍树；$y\\cos x\\,f_2'$ 用乘积法则。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=2x-y$：$u_x=2$，$u_y=-1$；$v=y\\sin x$：$v_x=y\\cos x$，$v_y=\\sin x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_x=f_1'u_x+f_2'v_x=2f_1'+y\\cos x\\,f_2'$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $2f_1'$ 对 $y$ 求导：$2\\left(f_{11}''u_y+f_{12}''v_y\\right)=-2f_{11}''+2\\sin x\\,f_{12}''$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $y\\cos x\\,f_2'$ 对 $y$ 求导（乘积法则）：$\\cos x\\,f_2'+y\\cos x\\left(f_{21}''u_y+f_{22}''v_y\\right)=\\cos x\\,f_2'-y\\cos x\\,f_{21}''+y\\sin x\\cos x\\,f_{22}''$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 相加，并用 $f_{12}''=f_{21}''$：$z_{xy}=-2f_{11}''+(2\\sin x-y\\cos x)f_{12}''+y\\sin x\\cos x\\,f_{22}''+\\cos x\\,f_2'$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"抽象函数的二阶混合偏导 → 先求 $z_x$，再对 $y$ 求导；$f_1'$、$f_2'$ 还是 $(u,v)$ 的函数，要再走一遍变量树，乘积项别漏。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"第④步乘积法则出来的 $\\cos x\\,f_2'$ 是最容易丢的一项。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"3"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知 $df(x,y)=(2x+y)\\,dx+(x+2y-3)\\,dy$，$f(0,0)=0$，求 $f(x,y)$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极小值 $f(-1,2)=-3$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先还原：$f_x=2x+y$ 对 $x$ 积分，常数写成 $\\varphi(y)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f=x^2+xy+y^2-3y$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f_x=2x+y$，对 $x$ 积分：$f=x^2+xy+\\varphi(y)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f_y=x+\\varphi'(y)$，和 $x+2y-3$ 比：$\\varphi'(y)=2y-3$，$\\varphi=y^2-3y+C$。$f(0,0)=0$ 得 $C=0$，$f=x^2+xy+y^2-3y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 驻点：$2x+y=0$，$x+2y-3=0$，解得 $x=-1$，$y=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $A=f_{xx}=2$，$B=f_{xy}=1$，$C=f_{yy}=2$，$AC-B^2=3>0$，$A>0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 极小值 $f(-1,2)=1-2+4-6=-3$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"函数没直接给出 → 先按节5 还原 $f$，再按「驻点 → $A$、$B$、$C$ → 判别式」求极值。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"驻点和 $A$、$B$、$C$ 直接用 $df$ 的两个系数就能算；还原 $f$ 只是为了算出极值是多少。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"6"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x,y)=x+(y-1)\\arcsin\\sqrt{\\dfrac xy}$，求 $f_x(x,1)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"求的是 $y=1$ 时的偏导，$y$ 不动，可以先代。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 代 $y=1$：$f(x,1)=x+0\\cdot\\arcsin\\sqrt x=x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f_x(x,1)=\\dfrac{d}{dx}x=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"对 $x$ 求偏导时 $y$ 本来就是常数，这里固定为 1 → 先代后导。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f_y(x,1)$ 就不能先代 $y=1$——$y$ 正是要变的那个变量。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"1"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"用变换 $\\xi=x-2y$，$\\eta=x+ay$ 可以把方程 $6\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x^2}+\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}-\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial y^2}=0$ 化简为 $\\dfrac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial\\xi\\partial\\eta}=0$，求常数 $a$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$a=3$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$z_x=z_\\xi+z_\\eta$，$z_y=-2z_\\xi+az_\\eta$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代入后 $z_{\\xi\\xi}$ 的系数自动是 0；$z_{\\eta\\eta}$ 的系数 $6+a-a^2$ 要为 0，$z_{\\xi\\eta}$ 的系数 $10+5a$ 不能为 0。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\xi_x=1$，$\\xi_y=-2$，$\\eta_x=1$，$\\eta_y=a$。$z_x=z_\\xi+z_\\eta$，$z_y=-2z_\\xi+az_\\eta$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $z_{xx}=z_{\\xi\\xi}+2z_{\\xi\\eta}+z_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $z_{xy}=\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(z_\\xi+z_\\eta)=(-2z_{\\xi\\xi}+az_{\\xi\\eta})+(-2z_{\\eta\\xi}+az_{\\eta\\eta})=-2z_{\\xi\\xi}+(a-2)z_{\\xi\\eta}+az_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $z_{yy}=-2(-2z_{\\xi\\xi}+az_{\\xi\\eta})+a(-2z_{\\eta\\xi}+az_{\\eta\\eta})=4z_{\\xi\\xi}-4az_{\\xi\\eta}+a^2z_{\\eta\\eta}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 代入 $6z_{xx}+z_{xy}-z_{yy}$：$z_{\\xi\\xi}$ 的系数 $6-2-4=0$；$z_{\\xi\\eta}$ 的系数 $12+(a-2)+4a=10+5a$；$z_{\\eta\\eta}$ 的系数 $6+a-a^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ 要化成 $z_{\\xi\\eta}=0$：$6+a-a^2=0$，$a=3$ 或 $a=-2$；又要 $10+5a\\ne0$，排除 $a=-2$。所以 $a=3$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"线性代换化简二阶方程 → 一阶、二阶都换成 $z_{\\xi\\xi},z_{\\xi\\eta},z_{\\eta\\eta}$，代入比较系数：该消的为 0，留下的不为 0。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$a=-2$ 时 $\\eta=x-2y=\\xi$，变换退化，整个方程都没了——「留下的系数不为 0」这一步就是为了排除它。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"5"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p6","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,y)=(x^2+y^2)\\sin\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\\ ((x,y)\\ne(0,0))$，$f(0,0)=0$。在 $(0,0)$ 处：偏导数存在吗？可微吗？偏导数连续吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"偏导都存在（都是 0）；可微，$df(0,0)=0$；偏导数在 $(0,0)$ 不连续。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"偏导用定义：$f(x,0)=x^2\\sin\\dfrac1{|x|}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"可微看 $\\dfrac f\\rho=\\rho\\sin\\dfrac1\\rho$；偏导连续要先求 $(x,y)\\ne(0,0)$ 处的 $f_x$，再沿 $x$ 轴让 $x\\to0^+$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 偏导：$f_x(0,0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x^2\\sin\\frac1{|x|}}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}x\\sin\\dfrac1{|x|}=0$（有界量乘无穷小）。$f_y(0,0)=\\lim\\limits_{y\\to0}y\\sin\\dfrac1{|y|}=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 可微：$\\dfrac{f-0-0\\cdot x-0\\cdot y}{\\rho}=\\rho\\sin\\dfrac1\\rho$，绝对值不超过 $\\rho\\to0$，可微，$df(0,0)=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 偏导函数：$(x,y)\\ne(0,0)$ 时 $f_x=2x\\sin\\dfrac1\\rho-\\dfrac{x}{\\rho}\\cos\\dfrac1\\rho$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 沿 $x$ 轴 $x\\to0^+$：$\\rho=x$，$f_x(x,0)=2x\\sin\\dfrac1x-\\cos\\dfrac1x$。第一项 $\\to0$，第二项在 $[-1,1]$ 里来回摆，没有极限。所以 $f_x$ 在 $(0,0)$ 不连续。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分段点按顺序查：偏导用定义 → 可微看 $\\dfrac{f-f(0,0)-Ax-By}{\\rho}$ → 偏导连续看偏导函数在原点的极限。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"这是「可微 ⇏ 偏导连续」的标准反例：可微只要求 $f$ 在原点附近贴着平面，不管偏导函数怎么振荡。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"2"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p7","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=f(x,y)$ 可微，$f(x,x^2)=1$，且 $f_x(x,x^2)=x$。求 $x\\ne0$ 时 $f_y(x,x^2)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-\\dfrac12$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"恒等式 $f(x,x^2)=1$ 两边对 $x$ 求导。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x(x,x^2)+2x\\,f_y(x,x^2)=0$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 两边对 $x$ 求导（链式法则）：$f_x(x,x^2)\\cdot1+f_y(x,x^2)\\cdot2x=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代入 $f_x(x,x^2)=x$：$x+2x\\,f_y(x,x^2)=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\ne0$，两边除以 $x$：$f_y(x,x^2)=-\\dfrac12$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x,x^2)=1$ 对所有 $x$ 成立，是一元复合多元的恒等式 → 两边对 $x$ 求导，就把 $f_x$、$f_y$ 联系起来了。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$f_x(x,x^2)$ 是「先求偏导，再代 $y=x^2$」，不是 $\\dfrac{d}{dx}f(x,x^2)$；后者是第①步左边那一整串。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"3"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p8","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $x^2-6xy+10y^2-2yz-z^2+18=0$ 确定，求 $z$ 的极值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"极小值 $z(9,3)=3$，极大值 $z(-9,-3)=-3$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$F_x=2x-6y=0$，$F_y=-6x+20y-2z=0$，得 $x=3y$，$z=y$，代回原方程。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"两个点：$(9,3)$ 处 $z=3$；$(-9,-3)$ 处 $z=-3$。$F_z=-2y-2z$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F=x^2-6xy+10y^2-2yz-z^2+18$：$F_x=2x-6y$，$F_y=-6x+20y-2z$，$F_z=-2y-2z$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F_x=0$ 得 $x=3y$；代入 $F_y=0$：$-18y+20y-2z=0$，$z=y$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代回原方程：$9y^2-18y^2+10y^2-2y^2-y^2+18=0$，即 $18-2y^2=0$，$y=\\pm3$。得 $(9,3)$ 处 $z=3$，$(-9,-3)$ 处 $z=-3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $F_{xx}=2$，$F_{xy}=-6$，$F_{yy}=20$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $(9,3)$，$z=3$：$F_z=-12$，$A=\\dfrac16$，$B=-\\dfrac12$，$C=\\dfrac53$，$AC-B^2=\\dfrac5{18}-\\dfrac14=\\dfrac1{36}>0$，$A>0$，极小值 3。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ $(-9,-3)$，$z=-3$：$F_z=12$，$A=-\\dfrac16$，$B=\\dfrac12$，$C=-\\dfrac53$，$AC-B^2=\\dfrac1{36}>0$，$A<0$，极大值 $-3$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"隐函数极值 → $F_x=F_y=0$ 和原方程联立求点和 $z$；每个点用 $A=-\\dfrac{F_{xx}}{F_z}$、$B=-\\dfrac{F_{xy}}{F_z}$、$C=-\\dfrac{F_{yy}}{F_z}$ 判别。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"极小值 3 比极大值 $-3$ 还大，不矛盾：它们在两个不同的点、两块不同的曲面上，各管各的附近。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"6"}]}]}